1025 {\rtlch \fcs1 \af6 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 In the third rank are placed, naturally and necessarily, the }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af6 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \i1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 reptiles}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af6 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 . They are going to provide us with new and greater proofs of the }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af6 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \i1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 degradation }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af6 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 in organic structure from one end to the other in the animal chain, starting at the most perfect animals. In fact, we do not see again in their hearts, which have only one ventricle, the structure which really belongs to the animals of the first and second ranks. Their blood is cold, almost like that of the animals of the later ranks.}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af6 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 \par }\pard \plain \li0 \ri0 \sl276 \slmult1 \widctlpar \keep0 \keepn0 \aspalpha \aspnum \toplinepunct0 \faauto \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs20 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \af5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 {\rtlch \fcs1 \af6 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 \par }\pard \plain \li0 \ri0 \sl276 \slmult1 \widctlpar \keep0 \keepn0 \as