24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 , the most improved among them, and in the fish called }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af6 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \i1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 cartilaginous}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af6 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 , the least improved. These two points confirm, within this very class, the }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af6 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \i1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 degradation}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af6 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025  in the organic structure. For the cartilaginous fish with their soft cartilaginous parts designed to make their bodies stronger and to make their movements easier show us that among them the skeleton ends, or rather that with them nature started to sketch out the skeleton.}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af6 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 \par }\pard \plain \li0 \ri0 \sl276 \slmult1 \widctlpar \keep0 \keepn0 \aspalpha \aspnum \toplinepunct0 \faauto \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs20 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af5 \loch \af5 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 {\rtlch \fcs1 \af6 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1025 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1025 \par }\pard \plain \li0 \ri0 \sl276 \slmult1 \widctlpar \keep0 \keepn0 \aspalpha \aspnum \toplinepunct0 \faauto \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \ltrch \fcs0 